e too. But after some time in middle of work I get error message flood or same result after restarting Godot project.\nI tried to manipulate palette image using aseprite by stretching vertically to make 56x56 and it still failed to import correctly.\n\nProbably blender file doesn't play a role there.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- open provided reproduction project (blank project with blender project + palette PNG file)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[bug-texture-import.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/30753899/bug-texture-import.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122140/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122140/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}